[00:00.00] 作词 : 陈绮贞
[00:01.00] 作曲 : 陈绮贞
[00:03.60]陈绮贞-Sentimental Kills
[00:10.64]> > > > > > > > > > > > > > > >
[00:27.60]
[02:00.53][00:28.60]Everytime when I fell asleep,
[02:06.44][00:34.21]I wish I won't pretend to sleep.
[02:11.52][00:39.28]Oh-No. . . . .
[02:15.66][00:43.39]Maybe I am a freak.
[02:18.51][00:46.12]
[02:23.72][00:51.57]Everytime when I shed a tear,
[02:29.30][00:57.30]How I wish I won't take responsibility to make you sorry.
[02:45.00][01:12.99]But the lazy days lie on my bed.
[02:51.85][01:19.95]The story goes on， years go by.
[02:57.52][01:25.56]The shadow tells me,
[03:01.34][01:29.20]SENTIMENTAL KILLS.
[03:08.02][01:35.45]
[03:10.63][01:37.97]Everytime when I fell asleep,
[03:16.39][01:43.62]I wish I really have a beautiful dream.
[03:26.22][01:53.24]To make me happy.
[01:58.92]
[03:34.13]Please, save save save me.
[03:44.96]
[04:01.81]ｅ　ｎ　ｄ
